& [Acceptance]
  + [B1NP-A01] source manifest input audit data design threat review seven-fold explosion justification matrix plan phase lock readiness review and satisfaction signature bind exactly before preparation
  + [B1NP-A02] pre-effect audit replays exact path hash file identity signer principal volume absence and free-space facts
  + [B1NP-A03] deterministic fixture preparation and Git identity verification pass with no outside-envelope change
  + [B1NP-A04] selected schema command runs at most once under bounded env-clear-first direct-process accounting and yields either an exact schema inventory or a quarantined refusal
  + [B1NP-A05] post-state evidence records role topology membership canaries Git and schema identities and confirms the principal repository candidate executable package and foreign paths were not child-write targets
  + [B1NP-A06] final B1 gap matrix remains honest and no live preflight is claimed before its second signature

& [DualHemisphere]
  + semantic hemisphere binds selection intent duties authority denials quarantine and final-lock obligation
  + physical hemisphere binds exact root creation deterministic fixture writes direct schema process and observed identities
  + convergence is a retained preparation result carrying no B1 runtime capability

& [Delineation]
